{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨日（28日）下午，警方接獲多宗報案，指荃灣大河道近鱟地坊一間烤魚店發生火警。</p><p>消防到場後大約10分鐘將火救熄。</p><p>現場消息指，該廳內所有職員及客人及時逃生，沒有傷亡。</p><p>據初步調查，懷疑涉及爐頭回火，網上相片可見事發時，有大量濃煙冒出。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:24.653967+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:26:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:43.705597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.869324+00:00","content_hash":"cbb526c225f494cdc547fd68d039d9ac97fc737daa566608879c212db5bfadf8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}